This file covers the **collected paper metadata** — everything under `data/`,
the JSON the site loads at runtime, and the CSV files under
`public/download/`. The **code** that collects, classifies and displays it
(the scripts, site pages and styling) is MIT-licensed; see [LICENSE](LICENSE).
The two are deliberately separate, because they carry different obligations.

